---
const modules = [
  {
    title: "Meta Lead Generation",
    lessons: 6,
    duration: "2h",
    icon: "📱"
  },
  {
    title: "Google Ads Optimizacija",
    lessons: 5,
    duration: "1.5h",
    icon: "🔍"
  },
  {
    title: "CRM Avtomatizacija",
    lessons: 7,
    duration: "3h",
    icon: "🔗"
  },
  {
    title: "AI Reporting",
    lessons: 4,
    duration: "1h",
    icon: "📊"
  },
  {
    title: "AI Support Agenti",
    lessons: 6,
    duration: "2.5h",
    icon: "🤖"
  },
  {
    title: "Call Analytics",
    lessons: 4,
    duration: "1.5h",
    icon: "🎙️"
  }
];
---

<section id="ucenje" class="learning theme-light" aria-label="Learning Hub">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="learning-head">
      <p class="chapter">04 — Učenje</p>
      <h2 class="display display-l" data-split>Learning Hub</h2>
      <p class="lede-sm" data-split>
        Študirajte na lastnem tempu z našimi strukturiranimi tečaji in mikro-vsebino.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      {modules.map((module) => (
        <article class="lesson" data-reveal>
          <span class="lesson-icon" aria-hidden="true">{module.icon}</span>
          <div>
            <div class="lesson-kicker">
              <span class="pill">Nov</span>
              <span>📚 {module.lessons} lekcij</span>
              <span>⏱️ {module.duration} naučnega časa</span>
            </div>
            <h3>{module.title}</h3>
          </div>
          <a href="#kontakt" class="link-arrow">Začni tečaj</a>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="lesson-panel theme-dark">
      <h3>Niste sigurni, kje začeti?</h3>
      <p>
        Naš AI-vodnik vas bo vodil skozi personalizirane priporoče glede na vaše potrebe in cilje.
      </p>
      <a href="#kontakt" class="btn btn-signal">Najdi svoj tečaj</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
